{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBound","@type":"LeanModule","name":"FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBound","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound_conditional","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound_conditional","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L71-L93","doc":"**Vorticity lower bound (conditional).**\n\nConditional on the q-NS conjecture cone, the q-NS vorticity\n`‖ω*‖_{L^∞}` along anti-parallel vortex-pair initial data\nsatisfies the separation decay (a), the `c₁/(T*−t)` lower bound\n(b), and the BKM time-integral divergence (c) — the vorticity\nblow-up signature of `conj:ns-counterexample`.\n\n*Derived* from the three directional hypotheses of\n`VorticityLowerBoundContext` (it composes them; it does not\nassume its own conclusion).\n\nRef: [leitner2026] §Fluid dynamics / Vorticity lower bound,\n     conj:vorticity-lower-bound ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:vorticity-lower-bound","label":"conj:vorticity-lower-bound","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.bkm_diverges","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.bkm_diverges","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L69-L69","doc":"**(c) BKM divergence.**  The time-integral of the vorticity sup-norm\nup to `T*` diverges — the conjectural input, witnessed here.\n\n**Parameterised 2026-09-13.**  `bkmIntegralDiverges` was a *field*\ntyped with the universe `Prop` alongside this witness, so the instance\nchose the proposition and `⟨True, trivial⟩` discharged sub-claim (c);\n`vorticity_lower_bound_conditional`'s third conjunct was therefore\nunconditional.  Fields (a) and (b) above were always genuinely\nencoded — only (c) was not, so this is the minimal fix.\n\nIt is a parameter rather than an encoding because stating the BKM\ndivergence needs an integral this class does not carry (`vortNorm` is\na bare `ℝ → ℝ` with no integrability hypothesis), and guessing at its\ncontent would be the author's call to make.  The conjectural input is\nuntouched and still open. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.vorticity_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.vorticity_lower","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L52-L52","doc":"**(b) Vorticity lower bound.**  `‖ω*(t)‖_{L^∞} ≥ c₁/(T*−t)`,\nthe stretching-driven concentration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.separation_decay","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.separation_decay","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L46-L46","doc":"**(a) Separation decay.**  `c₁·√(T*−t) ≤ d(t) ≤ c₂·√(T*−t)`\nfor `t < T*`, the Biot–Savart approach law. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.c₁_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.c₁_pos","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L43-L43","doc":"`c₁ > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.vortNorm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.vortNorm","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Limit-solution vorticity sup-norm `‖ω*(t)‖_{L^∞}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.dist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.dist","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Inter-filament separation `d(t)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.c₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.c₂","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Universal upper constant `c₂ > 0` (independent of `q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.c₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.c₁","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Universal lower constant `c₁ > 0` (independent of `q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.tStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.tStar","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Collision (blow-up) time `T*`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VorticityLowerBoundContext","kind":"class","line":13,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean#L13-L69","doc":"**Conditional hypotheses for the vorticity lower bound.**\n\nThe proposition is conditional on the q-NS conjecture cone\n(`conj:q-aubin-lions`, `conj:ns-counterexample`,\n`conj:critical-exponent`, `prop:blowup-yekutieli`,\n`conj:regularity-breakdown`).  Rather than concluding the vacuous\n`True`, this class carries the three analytic facts the\nproposition actually asserts as **explicit hypotheses**, and\n`vorticity_lower_bound_conditional` *derives* their conjunction\n(§3b-cond non-degenerate conditional pattern, the\n`q_bkm_criterion` exemplar).\n\nThe fields abstract the limit solution: `dist t` is the\ninter-filament separation `d(t)`, `vortNorm t` is\n`‖ω*(t)‖_{L^∞}`, `bkmIntegralDiverges` records the BKM\ntime-integral divergence, and `tStar` the collision time.  The\ninequalities are the bar-odd collapse signature of the\nanti-parallel filament collision. ","signatureChunk":0}]}